<report>
<title>Logrank and Wilcoxon tests</title>
<block name="outer">
<br />
<title>@title@strata:</title>
<block name="groups">

<p><u><subtotal>For group @grp</subtotal></u><br />
Observed deaths = @obs<br />
Extent of exposure to risk of death = @{ext:roundu}<br />
Relative rate = @{rel:roundu}</p>
</block>

<p>test statistics:<br />
@rank</p>

<p>variance-covariance matrix:</p>
<block name="covar"><p>@mat</p></block>

<p>Chi-square for equivalence of death rates = @{chi:roundu}  <pval>@{p:pval}</pval></p>
<block name="trends"><p>Chi-square for trend = @{trend:roundu} <pval> @{p_trend:pval}</pval></p></block>
<block name="strata">
<br />
<title>@test for COMBINED STRATA:</title>

<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>Deaths</th><th>Extent of exposure to risk of death</th><th>Relative rate</th></tr>
<block name="stratum"><tr><td>@grp</td><td>@res</td><td>@{sum:roundu}</td><td>@{tot:roundu}</td></tr></block>
</table>

<p>overall chi-square = @{chi_strata:roundu}  <pval>@{p_strata:pval}</pval></p>
<block name="strata_trend"><p>Chi-square for trend = @{strata_trend:roundu}<pval>  @{p_strata_trend:pval}</pval></p></block>
</block>
<block name="hazards">
<br />

<p>Hazard Ratio  <ci>(approximate @pc% confidence interval)</ci></p>
<block name="hazard"><p>@vs = @{haz:roundu}  <ci>(@{from:roundu} to @{to:roundu})</ci></p></block>
<block name="cml">

<p>Conditional maximum likelihood estimates:<br />
Hazard Ratio = @{hr:roundu}<br />
<ci>Exact Fisher @pc% confidence interval = @{llf:roundu} to @{ulf:roundu}</ci><br />
<pval>Exact Fisher one sided @{p1f:pval}, two sided @{p2f:pval}</pval><br />
<ci>Exact mid-P @pc% confidence interval = @{llm:roundu} to @{ulm:roundu}</ci><br />
<pval>Exact mid-P one sided @{p1m:pval}, two sided @{p2m:pval}</pval></p>
</block>
</block>
</block>
</report>
